---
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';
---

<section class="py-32 bg-surface-container-low px-6 md:px-8 border-y border-outline-variant/5" id="story">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center">
    <div class="space-y-8" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-headline leading-none uppercase tracking-tighter">
        STOP <span class="text-primary">CONTEXT</span> SWITCHING.
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          You're in the flow. The code is writing itself. Then you need a ticket ID — alt-tab, Chrome,
          forty-seven tabs screaming for attention. You find the ticket, but someone just replied on Slack.
        </p>
        <p class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2 italic font-medium bg-primary/5">
          "The terminal is where developers are most productive. Don't force them out of it."
        </p>
        <p>
          flowlane started as a side project at <a href="https://saply.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Saply</a> — one developer's refusal to do the browser dance,
          grown into a tool used every day. It's for the developer who lives on the home row, and for the
          team on Azure DevOps, GitHub, or Jira that wants tickets, branches, and PRs handled without
          switching tools. Link tickets, create branches, and push PRs without ever lifting your hands
          from the keyboard.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40">
        Built with gratitude to the team at <a href="https://saply.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Saply</a>, where flowlane began.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.15">
      <Terminal title="flowlane start 14" frameClass="aspect-square p-10 md:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full gap-6">
          <div>
            <div class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim">
              <span class="opacity-50">$ </span><span data-type="flowlane start 14"></span><span class="animate-pulse inline-block w-2 h-4 bg-primary align-middle ml-1"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="text-on-surface-variant">◇ 14 — Implement landingpage</div>
              <div class="text-on-surface-variant">◇ Branch name: 14-implement-landingpage</div>
              <div class="text-primary">◇ Pushed: 14-implement-landingpage</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-outline-variant/10 pt-4 text-[10px] leading-tight">
            <div class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim">✓ Branch ready!</div>
            <div class="text-on-surface-variant">Run flowlane pr 14 when you're ready to open a PR.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Terminal>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
